<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_bibliography"><a href="#bib" title="In Policy Gradient Guidance Enables Test Time Control" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">References</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A1" title="In Policy Gradient Guidance Enables Test Time Control" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">A </span>Derivations Problem of CFG in Policy</span></a>
<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_appendix">
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#A1.SS0.SSS0.Px1" title="In Appendix A Derivations Problem of CFG in Policy ‣ Policy Gradient Guidance Enables Test Time Control" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Derivation of CFG.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2" title="In Appendix A Derivations Problem of CFG in Policy ‣ Policy Gradient Guidance Enables Test Time Control" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Failure of Direct Analogy in Policy Gradient.</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A2" title="In Policy Gradient Guidance Enables Test Time Control" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">B </span>Detailed Results</span></a></li>
</ol></nav>
